<comment><![CDATA[Businessrule checking attributevalues, relationships and rows for consistency
A rule can apply for a single attribute(-value) (ATTRIBUTE-LEVEL), 
for several attributes within one entity (ROW-LEVEL)
for an entity (ENTITY-LEVEL)
for several entitites (DATABASE-LEVEL)

Standard rules defined in the model elements (keys, relationships (FK), domainvalue-restrictions) are not to be repeated as business rules.

Subtype of MODELELEMENT. BURU_ID is always identical to the corresponding MODE_ID]]></comment>
